<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίπλ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything double:</i> hence of the parallel streams of the
			'milky way', <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				346a24
			</span></i>; of 'doubled' position of foetus at birth, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>folded paper:</i> hence, <i>letter of recommendation,</i>
			esp. <i>passport,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				10.17.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fam.</u>
				6.12.3
			</span></i>; later, <i>order enabling a traveller to use the public
				post,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				665.25
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), etc.; <i>receipt</i> for
			payment of licences or taxes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.92
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>duplicate, counterpart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3276
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὄνων,</span> tax in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				213
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAmh.</u>
					2.92.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>double pot</i> for boiling unguents, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crito
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.37
			</span></i>.</div>
